{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224680/extras/a2303c0424b38c2f580ab5e3ada8023a.poster.avif?t=1759584121\" width=760 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224680/extras/a2303c0424b38c2f580ab5e3ada8023a.webm?t=1759584121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224680/extras/a2303c0424b38c2f580ab5e3ada8023a.mp4?t=1759584121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Automate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use simple logic building blocks to change signals and junctions. Create functioning train networks in order to deliver goods between stations in a timely matter. Transport enough cargo without any crashes to complete each level!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optimize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing each level is only the beginning! Improve your solutions in a never-ending quest for efficiency! A more efficient solution comes with more satisfaction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224680/extras/4b3f30c29a20d93bb1bd8117ab614f3e.poster.avif?t=1759584121\" width=392 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224680/extras/4b3f30c29a20d93bb1bd8117ab614f3e.webm?t=1759584121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224680/extras/4b3f30c29a20d93bb1bd8117ab614f3e.mp4?t=1759584121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your spot on each level's leader-board in one (or all) of the 4 unique scoring categories. Whether you're trying to one up your friends list, or climbing the global ladder, every improvement is more satisfying than the last!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has its own optional challenge restriction that adds a unique twist and offers new and refreshing puzzles to solve! Throw away your first solution and turns things on its head as you must change your approach!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3224680?t=1759584121","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3224680?t=1759584121","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224680/506a18c9a3e4670ad8b95203a91c2192e30ded2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759584121","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224680/506a18c9a3e4670ad8b95203a91c2192e30ded2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759584121","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224680/extras/a2303c0424b38c2f580ab5e3ada8023a.poster.avif?t=1759584121\" width=760 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224680/extras/a2303c0424b38c2f580ab5e3ada8023a.webm?t=1759584121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224680/extras/a2303c0424b38c2f580ab5e3ada8023a.mp4?t=1759584121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Automate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use simple logic building blocks to change signals and junctions. Create functioning train networks in order to deliver goods between stations in a timely matter. Transport enough cargo without any crashes to complete each level!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optimize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing each level is only the beginning! Improve your solutions in a never-ending quest for efficiency! A more efficient solution comes with more satisfaction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224680/extras/4b3f30c29a20d93bb1bd8117ab614f3e.poster.avif?t=1759584121\" width=392 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224680/extras/4b3f30c29a20d93bb1bd8117ab614f3e.webm?t=1759584121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224680/extras/4b3f30c29a20d93bb1bd8117ab614f3e.mp4?t=1759584121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your spot on each level's leader-board in one (or all) of the 4 unique scoring categories. Whether you're trying to one up your friends list, or climbing the global ladder, every improvement is more satisfying than the last!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has its own optional challenge restriction that adds a unique twist and offers new and refreshing puzzles to solve! Throw away your first solution and turns things on its head as you must change your approach!</p>","developers":["Logic Breaker Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224680/header.jpg?t=1759584121","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3224680/2115893374/25bc9d34ee3f4599088fe4970f99824078633a44/1756182286/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756183007